{"content":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"OWNER","body":"## Outcome\nRepair the open-goal schema migration path and project a valid portfolio DAG without losing managed goal state.\n\n## Acceptance\n- Open legacy/deferred goal records are normalized losslessly before portfolio graph evaluation.\n- Invalid records receive a per-goal actionable diagnostic instead of globally crashing workflow dispatch; only the affected goal and its parent/dependency prerequisite chain are execution-blocking.\n- The projected DAG preserves valid goal relationships and excludes unsupported state safely.\n\n## Verification\nCover v1 phase-evidence normalization, malformed-record diagnostics, and portfolio projection.\n\n\n<!-- zzzops-goal\n{\"issue\": 522, \"parent\": null, \"payload\": {\"hash\": \"sha256:ba92b62219ec8f43effbecc04d63ead2e0a3c881f8534cf698fbb1ca4ecb00dd\", \"uri\": \"zzzops:david-rzepa/zzzops:goal:522:sha256:ba92b62219ec8f43effbecc04d63ead2e0a3c881f8534cf698fbb1ca4ecb00dd\"}, \"repository\": \"david-rzepa/zzzops\", \"revision\": 73, \"schema_version\": 2, \"state\": \"open\"}\nzzzops-goal -->","closed_at":null,"closed_by":null,"comments":87,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/david-rzepa/zzzops/issues/522/comments","created_at":"2026-09-23T05:04:23Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/david-rzepa/zzzops/issues/522/events","html_url":"https://github.com/david-rzepa/zzzops/issues/522","id":5549035424,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working","id":11544396256,"name":"bug","node_id":"LA_kwDOTasXu88AAAACsBmB4A","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/david-rzepa/zzzops/labels/bug"},{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"5319E7","default":false,"description":"Managed by ZzzOps","id":11549538748,"name":"zzzops","node_id":"LA_kwDOTas